<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.3.9">
<l>aṉṟu vayiṟṟil kiṭantirun tēyaṭi maiceyya luṟṟiruppaṉ</l>
<l>iṉṟuvan tiṅkuṉṉaik kaṇṭukoṇ ṭēṉiṉip pōka viṭuvatuṇṭē</l>
<l>ceṉṟaṅku vāṇaṉai yāyiran tōḷun tiruccak karamataṉāl</l>
<l>teṉṟit ticaiticai vīḻacceṟ ṟāytiru māliruñ cōlaiyentāy</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>I, who have been loving and serving [you] since I lay in the womb,</l>
<l>came here today and seeing you I took you in.</l>
<l>How could I [let you] leave now?</l>
<l>My Father in Tirumāliruñcōlai,</l>
<l rend="indent">you who went there and killed Bāṇa with [your] blessed discus,</l>
<l>scattering [his] thousand arms so that they fell</l>
<l rend="indent">in every direction.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
